45:51.000 --> 45:51.950
I can't believe it.

45:52.000 --> 45:54.950
Everyone on the beach is looking and laughing.

45:55.000 --> 45:55.950
Say something to her.

45:56.000 --> 45:59.950
I told her not to wear it, but she didn't listen.

46:00.000 --> 46:00.950
She looks like...

46:01.000 --> 46:02.950
She looks like...

46:03.000 --> 46:04.950
It's the bikini she's wearing.

46:05.000 --> 46:08.950
A bottom looks like two half-deflated hot air balloons.

46:09.000 --> 46:09.950
No, I can't look.

46:10.000 --> 46:10.950
Makes me feel ill.

46:11.000 --> 46:11.950
Look at the other way.

46:12.000 --> 46:13.950
It's difficult to look the other way.

46:14.000 --> 46:15.950
I know what you mean.

46:16.000 --> 46:18.950
Oh, there are some really thick guys on the beach.

46:19.000 --> 46:20.950
Really awesome.

46:21.000 --> 46:22.950
You all right, Josie?

46:23.000 --> 46:23.950
See you soon.

46:24.000 --> 46:24.950
Where are you going, mother?

46:25.000 --> 46:25.950
Excellent.

46:26.000 --> 46:26.950
Don't worry.

46:27.000 --> 46:29.950
What is your mother doing now?

46:30.000 --> 46:30.950
Why is she talking to him?

46:31.000 --> 46:32.950
Oh, he's real fit.

46:33.000 --> 46:33.950
Stop it, Josie.

46:34.000 --> 46:35.950
I don't know what she's doing.

46:36.000 --> 46:37.950
I really don't know.

46:38.000 --> 46:39.000
No.

46:43.000 --> 46:45.950
Excuse me, young man.

46:46.000 --> 46:48.950
It would be really nice if you could help me.

46:49.000 --> 46:50.950
What's the matter, dear?

46:51.000 --> 46:53.950
I'm not as young as I used to be, and I...

46:54.000 --> 46:54.950
No problem.

46:55.000 --> 46:56.950
What can I do for you?

46:57.000 --> 46:57.950
Put up your deck chair?

46:58.000 --> 46:58.950
No.

46:59.000 --> 46:59.950
Carry your bag?

47:00.000 --> 47:00.950
No.

47:01.000 --> 47:02.950
Just tell me what you want.

47:03.000 --> 47:03.950
Happy to help you?

47:04.000 --> 47:07.000
Can you rub some suntan oil over my body?

47:08.000 --> 47:08.950
What?

47:09.000 --> 47:14.950
Well, I'm very busy at the moment.

47:15.000 --> 47:17.950
I'm allergic to suntan oil.

47:18.000 --> 47:20.950
I think my wife is waving at me.

47:21.000 --> 47:21.950
Must go.

47:22.000 --> 47:22.950
Bye.

47:23.000 --> 47:24.950
Maybe tomorrow.

47:25.000 --> 47:26.950
I'm leaving today.

47:27.000 --> 47:28.000
What a pity.

47:33.000 --> 47:34.950
What did you do, mother?

47:35.000 --> 47:35.950
Why is he running away?

47:36.000 --> 47:37.950
I just asked him to help me.

47:38.000 --> 47:39.950
What did you ask him to do?

47:40.000 --> 47:41.950
Nothing much.

47:42.000 --> 47:47.950
Nancy, do you think I can take my bikini off to get an oil over body turn?

47:48.000 --> 47:49.950
No, you cannot!

47:50.000 --> 47:52.950
I want an ice cream, Mum.

47:53.000 --> 47:54.950
I want some money.

47:55.000 --> 47:55.950
Here you are.

47:56.000 --> 47:58.950
Can you get us all an ice cream, Josie?

47:59.000 --> 47:59.950
You can choose.

48:00.000 --> 48:01.950
Okay.

48:02.000 --> 48:05.000
I can go and see if Boris is okay and look for...

48:06.000 --> 48:07.950
Er... something.

48:08.000 --> 48:12.950
Your daughter is saying some very strange things these days, Nancy.

48:13.000 --> 48:14.950
She's your daughter as well.

48:15.000 --> 48:15.950
Oh, yes.

48:16.000 --> 48:18.000
I suppose she is.

48:22.000 --> 48:22.950
Here you are.

48:23.000 --> 48:24.950
Ice cream is for everyone.

48:25.000 --> 48:25.950
Thank you.

48:26.000 --> 48:28.950
Boris is unhappy in the car alone.

48:29.000 --> 48:31.950
The ice cream man was really buff.

48:32.000 --> 48:34.000
Great body.

48:35.000 --> 48:35.950
What does that mean?

48:36.000 --> 48:37.950
Oh, you're so old.

48:38.000 --> 48:38.950
Don't you know?

48:39.000 --> 48:40.950
When I was young...

48:41.000 --> 48:42.950
Oh, yes, Dad. Not again.

48:43.000 --> 48:44.950
It gave me his phone number.

48:45.000 --> 48:45.950
You are not meeting him.

48:46.000 --> 48:46.950
You are too young.

48:47.000 --> 48:48.950
