48:49.000 --> 48:50.950
That's not fair.

48:51.000 --> 48:52.950
He asked me for a drink.

48:53.000 --> 48:53.950
That's all.

48:54.000 --> 48:54.950
We can all come with you.

48:55.000 --> 48:55.950
What?

48:56.000 --> 48:57.950
Let her go by herself.

48:58.000 --> 48:58.950
Don't interfere.

48:59.000 --> 48:59.950
She's our daughter.

49:00.000 --> 49:02.950
I think it's okay for Josie to meet him.

49:03.000 --> 49:04.950
It's only for a drink.

49:05.000 --> 49:06.950
Don't you trust your daughter, Pete?

49:07.000 --> 49:08.950
She is too young.

49:09.000 --> 49:10.950
