53:04.000 --> 53:04.950
I don't believe it.

53:05.000 --> 53:07.950
There's a fly swimming in my Earl Grey.

53:08.000 --> 53:08.950
Do something then.

53:09.000 --> 53:10.950
Don't just look at it.

53:11.000 --> 53:11.950
Give me the newspaper.

53:12.000 --> 53:13.950
No, don't do that.

53:14.000 --> 53:16.950
Oh, why did you do that?

53:17.000 --> 53:18.950
You're so stupid.

53:19.000 --> 53:19.950
