53:20.000 --> 53:21.950
Oh, yes, you killed the fly.

53:22.000 --> 53:24.950
But your hot tea went all over my dress.

53:25.000 --> 53:26.950
Look what happened.

53:27.000 --> 53:27.950
It's not so bad.

53:28.000 --> 53:28.950
Yes, it is.

53:29.000 --> 53:30.950
Look, I can't wear this.

53:31.000 --> 53:31.950
You can wash it.

53:32.000 --> 53:32.950
No problem.

53:33.000 --> 53:34.000
Why can't you wash it?

53:35.000 --> 53:39.950
Why is life so difficult with you, Pete?

53:40.000 --> 53:42.950
I don't know what you mean.

53:43.000 --> 53:47.950
We came to Blackpool to have a holiday, but so far it isn't happening.

53:48.000 --> 53:51.950
I'm going back to the hotel to have a rest on the bed.

53:52.000 --> 53:54.950
Bit of peace and quiet is what I need now.

53:55.000 --> 53:56.950
I can come with you.

53:57.000 --> 53:57.950
No, no.

53:58.000 --> 53:58.950
It's okay.

53:59.000 --> 54:01.950
You stay here and destroy some more cups.

54:02.000 --> 54:05.950
You can meet Mum and Josie and then come back to the hotel later.

54:06.000 --> 54:07.950
If you think that is the best thing to do.

54:08.000 --> 54:09.950
Yes, yes, definitely.

54:10.000 --> 54:11.950
Okay, Nancy.

54:12.000 --> 54:14.950
Go to bed if you think it's what you need.

54:15.000 --> 54:17.950
I think bed is a good idea.

54:18.000 --> 54:20.950
A very good idea.

54:21.000 --> 54:23.000
See you later.

54:26.000 --> 54:27.950
Can I pay, please?

54:28.000 --> 54:30.950
Yes, sorry about the cups.

54:31.000 --> 54:33.950
My wife got angry and had an accident.

54:34.000 --> 54:35.000
Women.

54:42.000 --> 54:43.950
Oh, hello, Grand.

54:44.000 --> 54:45.950
Josephine, not with you?

54:46.000 --> 54:46.950
Hello.

54:47.000 --> 54:50.950
No, Josephine is licking an ice cream.

54:51.000 --> 54:51.950
What is the matter?

54:52.000 --> 54:52.950
My tooth.

54:53.000 --> 54:54.950
I lost them.

54:55.000 --> 54:56.950
How did you do that?

54:57.000 --> 54:58.950
I went on the Dodgeham cars.

54:59.000 --> 55:02.950
And this nice widow had knocked into me and they went flying into the air.

55:03.000 --> 55:03.950
Oh, dear.

55:04.000 --> 55:05.950
Oh, dear.

55:06.000 --> 55:07.950
What a pity.

55:08.000 --> 55:08.950
Hope you find them.

55:09.000 --> 55:10.950
You can't eat without them.

55:11.000 --> 55:12.950
I spare pear as at home.

55:13.000 --> 55:13.950
Pity.

55:14.000 --> 55:15.950
Maybe you can get a straw in the hotel.

55:16.000 --> 55:17.950
That's a good idea.

55:18.000 --> 55:19.950
Well, have fun.

55:20.000 --> 55:21.950
I'm walking around the pleasure beach for a while.

55:22.000 --> 55:23.950
Nancy is back at the hotel.

55:24.000 --> 55:24.950
Bye.

55:25.000 --> 55:26.000
Bye.

55:28.000 --> 55:32.950
Where's my car?

55:33.000 --> 55:34.950
It's not in the car park.

55:35.000 --> 55:35.950
It's stolen.

55:36.000 --> 55:36.950
Can someone help?

55:37.000 --> 55:37.950
Where is everyone?

55:38.000 --> 55:39.950
Where's that Italian manager?

55:40.000 --> 55:42.950
When you want someone, call the police.

55:43.000 --> 55:44.950
Nancy?

55:45.000 --> 55:47.950
Nancy, open the door.

55:48.000 --> 55:48.950
Throw in the police.

55:49.000 --> 55:50.950
My car, it's stolen.

55:51.000 --> 55:52.950
Open the door.

55:53.000 --> 55:54.950
Where is everyone?

55:55.000 --> 55:56.950
Are you asleep?

55:57.000 --> 55:58.950
I don't believe it.

55:59.000 --> 55:59.950
Where is she?

56:00.000 --> 56:00.950
Women.

56:01.000 --> 56:02.950
Of course.

56:03.000 --> 56:03.950
My mobile.

56:04.000 --> 56:05.950
I have it in my pocket.

56:06.000 --> 56:06.950
Nine.

56:07.000 --> 56:07.950
Nine.

56:08.000 --> 56:08.950
Nine.

56:09.000 --> 56:11.950
Hello?

56:12.000 --> 56:13.950
Yes, it's an emergency.

56:14.000 --> 56:14.950
Police.

56:15.000 --> 56:16.950
My car is stolen.

56:17.000 --> 56:18.950
Hotel Grand Park.

56:19.000 --> 56:21.000
On the seafront.

56:22.000 --> 56:26.950
Registration F-H-W-2-9-6-K.

56:27.000 --> 56:28.950
What?

56:29.000 --> 56:29.950
My name?

56:30.000 --> 56:31.950
I'm Britain.

56:32.000 --> 56:32.950
Pete Britain.

56:33.000 --> 56:35.000
Come quickly.

56:38.000 --> 56:38.950
What's the problem, Dad?

56:39.000 --> 56:40.950
I can hear you from outside.

56:41.000 --> 56:41.950
The car.

56:42.000 --> 56:42.950
It's stolen.

56:43.000 --> 56:43.950
God!

56:44.000 --> 56:44.950
Where's Boris?

56:45.000 --> 56:45.950
What?

56:46.000 --> 56:46.950
Who?

56:47.000 --> 56:47.950
Oh, Boris.

56:48.000 --> 56:48.950
I don't know.

56:49.000 --> 56:50.000
In the car.

56:51.000 --> 56:51.950
Driving the car.

56:52.000 --> 56:52.950
Come down, Dad.

56:53.000 --> 56:53.950
Don't get hysterical.

56:54.000 --> 56:55.950
Boris can't drive the car.

56:56.000 --> 56:56.950
He's too young.

56:57.000 --> 56:58.950
He doesn't have a license.

56:59.000 --> 57:00.950
What are you talking about?

57:01.000 --> 57:01.950
Boris doesn't have a license.

57:02.000 --> 57:03.950
What are you talking about?

57:04.000 --> 57:04.950
It's a joke, Dad.

57:05.000 --> 57:05.950
Stay cool.

57:06.000 --> 57:08.000
I am cool.

57:10.000 --> 57:10.950
The police are here.

57:11.000 --> 57:12.000
Come on.

57:21.000 --> 57:22.950
Good morning, sir.

57:23.000 --> 57:24.950
Oh, no.

57:25.000 --> 57:25.950
It's you.

57:26.000 --> 57:27.950
Yes, it's me, sir.

57:28.000 --> 57:29.950
Nice to see you again, sir.

57:30.000 --> 57:30.950
Hmm.

57:31.000 --> 57:32.950
What's the problem, sir?

57:33.000 --> 57:33.950
My car.

57:34.000 --> 57:34.950
It's not in the car park.

57:35.000 --> 57:35.950
It's a classic car.

57:36.000 --> 57:37.950
It's probably sold by now.

57:38.000 --> 57:38.950
And it's out of the country.

57:39.000 --> 57:40.950
I don't think so, sir.

57:41.000 --> 57:42.950
How do you know?

57:43.000 --> 57:43.950
It's a very special car.

57:44.000 --> 57:45.950
There aren't many left in the world.

57:46.000 --> 57:47.950
Don't worry, sir.

57:48.000 --> 57:49.950
Of course I worry.

57:50.000 --> 57:50.950
It's my car.

57:51.000 --> 57:54.950
