57:55.000 --> 57:55.950
Yes?

57:56.000 --> 57:56.950
Wonderful.

57:57.000 --> 57:57.950
Where is it?

57:58.000 --> 57:59.950
Where we found it, sir.

58:00.000 --> 58:00.950
Yes, sir.

58:01.000 --> 58:02.950
One mile from here.

58:03.000 --> 58:05.950
It broke down in the middle of the high streets.

58:06.000 --> 58:09.950
