58:10.000 --> 58:16.950
No one can get into the car to move it because your mad dog attacks anyone who tries to get into it.

58:17.000 --> 58:18.950
My car is okay.

58:19.000 --> 58:24.950
We would be very grateful if you could come and move your car, sir, before we shoot your mad beast.

58:25.000 --> 58:26.950
You can't shoot, Boris.

58:27.000 --> 58:27.950
We can.

58:28.000 --> 58:29.950
We certainly can.

58:30.000 --> 58:35.000
So both of you come with me in my car now, please.

58:48.000 --> 58:49.950
Where is everyone?

58:50.000 --> 58:51.950
It's late.

58:52.000 --> 58:53.950
Don't worry, Nancy.

58:54.000 --> 58:55.950
Oh, here comes your mother.

58:56.000 --> 58:56.950
Oh, Nancy.

58:57.000 --> 58:58.950
I can't find them.

58:59.000 --> 59:00.950
I lost my teeth.

59:01.000 --> 59:01.950
What are you talking about?

59:02.000 --> 59:03.950
Oh, didn't Pete tell you?

59:04.000 --> 59:05.950
No, I was busy.

59:06.000 --> 59:07.950
Oh, anyway.

59:08.000 --> 59:08.950
What happened?

59:09.000 --> 59:09.950
Where's Josephine?

59:10.000 --> 59:11.950
She went off to have a bitter ice cream.

59:12.000 --> 59:13.950
Where is she now?

59:14.000 --> 59:15.950
And where is Pete?

59:16.000 --> 59:17.950
What a holiday.

59:18.000 --> 59:20.950
This nice widower helped me look.

59:21.000 --> 59:21.950
Who?

59:22.000 --> 59:22.950
Where?

59:23.000 --> 59:24.950
For your lost teeth?

59:25.000 --> 59:25.950
Yes.

59:26.000 --> 59:29.950
I crashed on the Dodgeham cars and they came out of my mouth.

59:30.000 --> 59:32.950
Oh, terrible mother.

59:33.000 --> 59:33.950
There you are.

59:34.000 --> 59:36.950
Oh, there you both are.

59:37.000 --> 59:37.950
What happened?

59:38.000 --> 59:39.950
I can ask you the same question.

59:40.000 --> 59:41.950
Where were you when I knocked on the bedroom door?

59:42.000 --> 59:44.950
The car was stolen with Boris inside.

59:45.000 --> 59:46.950
So now you must buy a new car.

59:47.000 --> 59:48.950
No, it's OK.

59:49.000 --> 59:50.950
The police found it in the High Street.

59:51.000 --> 59:51.950
What a pity.

59:52.000 --> 59:53.950
And where were you this afternoon, Josephine?

59:54.000 --> 59:56.950
I thought you were going on the ghost train with your grandmother.

59:57.000 --> 59:59.950
You weren't with your grandmother, Josephine?

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:01.950
No, I, er...

01:00:02.000 --> 01:00:03.950
went shopping for clothes.

01:00:04.000 --> 01:00:06.950
Your grandmother told me you went for an ice cream.

01:00:07.000 --> 01:00:08.950
Er, that as well.

01:00:09.000 --> 01:00:10.950
I am confused.

01:00:11.000 --> 01:00:12.950
I don't know where I am.

01:00:13.000 --> 01:00:15.950
Is this all so important?

01:00:16.000 --> 01:00:18.950
I think we all need a nice cup of tea.

01:00:19.000 --> 01:00:20.950
You're right, Mum.

01:00:21.000 --> 01:00:25.950
Luigi, can we all have some tea and cakes in the restaurant, please?

01:00:26.000 --> 01:00:28.950
Yes, of course.

01:00:29.000 --> 01:00:33.950
And can you book us a table in your restaurant for a celebration tomorrow evening?

01:00:34.000 --> 01:00:35.950
Of course, Nancy.

01:00:36.000 --> 01:00:37.950
What is the occasion?

01:00:38.000 --> 01:00:40.950
It's my birthday, but I don't feel like celebrating.

01:00:41.000 --> 01:00:43.950
Perhaps something revealing is going to happen.

01:00:44.000 --> 01:00:46.950
The naked truth?

01:00:47.000 --> 01:00:48.950
Are you talking about?

01:00:49.000 --> 01:00:51.950
I don't understand, women.

01:00:52.000 --> 01:00:54.950
Wait and see!

01:00:55.000 --> 01:00:57.000
Wait, Nancy!

01:00:58.000 --> 01:00:59.950
This is nice, isn't it?

01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:01.950
I don't like the food.

01:01:02.000 --> 01:01:03.950
It's foreign muck.

01:01:04.000 --> 01:01:06.950
I don't understand the menus.

01:01:07.000 --> 01:01:08.950
Stop moaning.

01:01:09.000 --> 01:01:10.950
This is my birthday.

01:01:11.000 --> 01:01:13.950
Oh, you're having a nice time, aren't we?

01:01:14.000 --> 01:01:16.950
I can't eat this maple tea.

01:01:17.000 --> 01:01:18.950
I don't like the food.

01:01:19.000 --> 01:01:20.950
It's foreign muck.

01:01:21.000 --> 01:01:22.950
I don't understand the menus.

01:01:23.000 --> 01:01:23.950
Stop moaning.

01:01:24.000 --> 01:01:25.950
This is my birthday.

01:01:26.000 --> 01:01:29.950
This meat without my teeth and this straw doesn't help.

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:31.950
Mother, please.

01:01:32.000 --> 01:01:33.950
Don't make that noise.

01:01:34.000 --> 01:01:36.950
It's difficult to eat, Nancy.

01:01:37.000 --> 01:01:39.950
Can I ask the waiter to cut up my meat?

01:01:40.000 --> 01:01:41.950
No, you can't.

01:01:42.000 --> 01:01:43.950
Let me do it.

01:01:44.000 --> 01:01:47.950
Do you like your meal, Pete?

01:01:48.000 --> 01:01:50.950
It's okay, but it's very expensive.

01:01:51.000 --> 01:01:53.950
I prefer fish and chips.

01:01:54.000 --> 01:01:56.950
I thought this would be nice for your birthday.

01:01:57.000 --> 01:01:58.950
Yes, dear.

01:01:59.000 --> 01:01:59.950
Thank you, dear.

01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:01.950
Oh, look over there!

01:02:02.000 --> 01:02:02.950
Where, Mum?

01:02:03.000 --> 01:02:03.950
There!

01:02:04.000 --> 01:02:05.950
It's the lovely widower who helped me yesterday.

01:02:06.000 --> 01:02:07.950
Which one, Grand?

01:02:08.000 --> 01:02:08.950
Him!

01:02:09.000 --> 01:02:09.950
Opposite her!

01:02:10.000 --> 01:02:11.950
Next to the other man with the shirt.

01:02:12.000 --> 01:02:12.950
Try!

01:02:13.000 --> 01:02:13.950
Ooh!

01:02:14.000 --> 01:02:14.950
Hurry!

01:02:15.000 --> 01:02:16.950
Mum, stop it.

01:02:17.000 --> 01:02:17.950
Stop waving.

01:02:18.000 --> 01:02:19.950
Your mother is impossible.

01:02:20.000 --> 01:02:21.950
Do something, Nancy.

01:02:22.000 --> 01:02:22.950
What do you suggest?

01:02:23.000 --> 01:02:26.950
Tying her to the chair and potting her sock in her mouth is a good idea.

01:02:27.000 --> 01:02:28.950
He's coming to our table.

01:02:29.000 --> 01:02:30.950
Oh, lovely.

01:02:31.000 --> 01:02:32.950
Oh, he has my teeth.

01:02:33.000 --> 01:02:34.950
He found my teeth.

01:02:35.000 --> 01:02:36.950
Oh, thank you so much.

01:02:37.000 --> 01:02:39.950
Let me give you a big kiss.

01:02:40.000 --> 01:02:41.950
Oh, come on, Mum.

01:02:42.000 --> 01:02:42.950
Sit down.

01:02:43.000 --> 01:02:44.950
Everyone in the restaurant is watching.

01:02:45.000 --> 01:02:46.950
But I'm so happy.

01:02:47.000 --> 01:02:49.000
I have my teeth.

01:02:50.000 --> 01:02:51.950
Ah!

01:02:52.000 --> 01:02:54.950
Now I can eat this meat.

01:02:55.000 --> 01:02:56.950
Oh, that's much better.

01:02:57.000 --> 01:02:58.950
I suddenly don't feel like eating anymore.

01:02:59.000 --> 01:03:00.950
Sorry, Nancy.

01:03:01.000 --> 01:03:02.950
I understand.

01:03:03.000 --> 01:03:04.950
Why have you stopped eating, Pete?

01:03:05.000 --> 01:03:06.950
I feel so hungry now.

01:03:07.000 --> 01:03:08.950
Did me your plate.

01:03:09.000 --> 01:03:10.950
I can eat your dinner as well.

01:03:11.000 --> 01:03:12.950
I don't believe it.

01:03:13.000 --> 01:03:15.950
Oh, no.

01:03:16.000 --> 01:03:18.950
Look, they're the police.

01:03:19.000 --> 01:03:20.950
I know they're looking for me.

01:03:21.000 --> 01:03:21.950
Help me, Nancy.

01:03:22.000 --> 01:03:22.950
Don't let us see me.

01:03:23.000 --> 01:03:24.950
Oh, don't be so stupid.

01:03:25.000 --> 01:03:29.950
She's not looking for you.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:31.950
Well, she's coming to our table.

01:03:32.000 --> 01:03:34.950
I think she is looking for you.

01:03:35.000 --> 01:03:35.950
Pete?

01:03:36.000 --> 01:03:37.950
Pete, where are you?

01:03:38.000 --> 01:03:39.950
I'm under the table.

01:03:40.000 --> 01:03:41.950
Don't tell her I'm here.

01:03:42.000 --> 01:03:43.950
Say I'm not here.

01:03:44.000 --> 01:03:45.950
Say I went to Spain.

01:03:46.000 --> 01:03:49.950
Or I'm at the dentist or anything.

01:03:50.000 --> 01:03:50.950
Stupid Pete.

01:03:51.000 --> 01:03:51.950
Sit in your chair.

01:03:52.000 --> 01:03:53.950
She's going to arrest you, Pete.

01:03:54.000 --> 01:03:55.950
Oh, how exciting.

01:03:56.000 --> 01:03:57.950
Over here, Constable.

01:03:58.000 --> 01:03:59.950
He's hiding under the table.

01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:01.950
Here it is.

01:04:02.000 --> 01:04:03.950
Thank you very, very much.

01:04:04.000 --> 01:04:04.950
Just you wait.

01:04:05.000 --> 01:04:06.950
You wait.

01:04:07.000 --> 01:04:07.950
Oh!

01:04:08.000 --> 01:04:09.950
Hello, Constable.

01:04:10.000 --> 01:04:12.950
I was just picking up my shoelace.

01:04:13.000 --> 01:04:14.950
I'm trying up my serviette.

01:04:15.000 --> 01:04:15.950
No.

01:04:16.000 --> 01:04:17.950
What is happening?

01:04:18.000 --> 01:04:20.950
You don't look like a real police woman.

01:04:21.000 --> 01:04:21.950
Wait.

01:04:22.000 --> 01:04:22.950
You...

01:04:23.000 --> 01:04:23.950
Wearing...

01:04:24.000 --> 01:04:25.950
High heels.

01:04:26.000 --> 01:04:26.950
And...

01:04:27.000 --> 01:04:27.950
Lipstick.

01:04:28.000 --> 01:04:29.950
Short...

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:30.950
Skirt.

01:04:31.000 --> 01:04:35.950
Excuse me, you sir.

01:04:36.000 --> 01:04:38.950
Why are you taking off your uniform?

01:04:39.000 --> 01:04:41.950
It's not hot in here.

01:04:42.000 --> 01:04:43.950
What are you doing?

01:04:44.000 --> 01:04:44.950
Please stop it.

01:04:45.000 --> 01:04:45.950
Now...

01:04:46.000 --> 01:04:47.950
It's okay, Nancy.

01:04:48.000 --> 01:04:48.950
It's fun.

01:04:49.000 --> 01:04:50.950
I feel like joining myself.

01:04:51.000 --> 01:04:52.950
Don't bother.

01:04:53.000 --> 01:04:53.950
Pete.

01:04:54.000 --> 01:04:54.950
Do something.

01:04:55.000 --> 01:04:56.950
Everyone is looking.

01:04:57.000 --> 01:04:58.950
Put your tongue back in your mouth.

01:04:59.000 --> 01:04:59.950
You look stupid.

01:05:00.000 --> 01:05:01.950
Oh.

01:05:02.000 --> 01:05:02.950
Hello.

01:05:03.000 --> 01:05:03.950
Oh, no.

01:05:04.000 --> 01:05:04.950
Ah, yes.

01:05:05.000 --> 01:05:06.950
Whose idea is this?

01:05:07.000 --> 01:05:07.950
Stop now, please.

01:05:08.000 --> 01:05:10.950
It's a stipper ground for Pete's birthday.

01:05:11.000 --> 01:05:12.950
I organized it with Josie.

01:05:13.000 --> 01:05:14.950
Happy birthday, Pete.

01:05:15.000 --> 01:05:17.950
I don't think it is a very good present.

01:05:18.000 --> 01:05:21.950
What do you think, Pete?

01:05:22.000 --> 01:05:22.950
Pete?

01:05:23.000 --> 01:05:23.950
Yes, dear.

01:05:24.000 --> 01:05:24.950
Whatever you say, dear.

01:05:25.000 --> 01:05:25.950
Stop this now.

01:05:26.000 --> 01:05:26.950
Oh, my God.

01:05:27.000 --> 01:05:27.950
They're not real.

01:05:28.000 --> 01:05:28.950
They can't be.

01:05:29.000 --> 01:05:29.950
No, dear.

01:05:30.000 --> 01:05:30.950
Yes, dear.

01:05:31.000 --> 01:05:31.950
Whatever you say to you.

01:05:32.000 --> 01:05:32.950
Green.

01:05:33.000 --> 01:05:33.950
Look.

01:05:34.000 --> 01:05:34.950
Watch the matter, Jos.

01:05:35.000 --> 01:05:35.950
Look.

01:05:36.000 --> 01:05:36.950
It's...

01:05:37.000 --> 01:05:37.950
No, it's Robbie.

01:05:38.000 --> 01:05:38.950
Where?

01:05:39.000 --> 01:05:39.950
Behind Dad.

01:05:40.000 --> 01:05:40.950
Oh.

01:05:41.000 --> 01:05:43.950
He's walking around the place on one's stripper's foot.

01:05:44.000 --> 01:05:45.950
Don't something grind?

01:05:46.000 --> 01:05:47.950
What's the matter with you two?

01:05:48.000 --> 01:05:48.950
Oh.

01:05:49.000 --> 01:05:49.950
Nothing, Mum.

01:05:50.000 --> 01:05:51.950
What a birthday.

01:05:52.000 --> 01:05:54.000
What a birthday.

01:05:58.000 --> 01:05:59.950
What happened?

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:00.950
I was enjoying that.

01:06:01.000 --> 01:06:01.950
Where is she?

01:06:02.000 --> 01:06:02.950
Why is she screaming?

01:06:03.000 --> 01:06:03.950
I didn't touch her.

01:06:04.000 --> 01:06:04.950
Come on, Grant.

01:06:05.000 --> 01:06:05.950
Cut it off, Robin.

01:06:06.000 --> 01:06:08.000
I'm coming with you, Josie.

01:06:09.000 --> 01:06:11.950
What are you all doing on your own mat?

01:06:12.000 --> 01:06:13.950
Come back here.

01:06:14.000 --> 01:06:15.950
What a day.

01:06:16.000 --> 01:06:17.950
What a holiday.

01:06:18.000 --> 01:06:20.950
I don't understand the English.

01:06:21.000 --> 01:06:24.950
They are very, very strange people.

01:06:25.000 --> 01:06:26.950
Look.

01:06:27.000 --> 01:06:29.000
Oh, my God.

01:06:38.000 --> 01:06:40.000
Thank you.
